  "content": "<article class=\"gv-story gv-photo-video\"><header class=\"gv-intro\"><p class=\"gv-kicker\">Brooklyn, New York · Wedding photography &amp; film</p><h1>Alexandria &amp; James · Selena &amp; Dashmir<br><em>Giando on the Water</em></h1><p class=\"gv-lede\">Two weddings at Giando on the Water, presented as separate GioLina films.</p></header><nav class=\"gv-client-navigation\" aria-label=\"Choose a celebration\"><a class=\"gv-client-card\" href=\"#alexandria-james\"><img src=\"/assets/alexandria-james.png\" width=\"442\" height=\"180\" alt=\"Alexandria &amp; James, a still from the GioLina wedding film\" decoding=\"async\"><span>Alexandria &amp; James</span></a><a class=\"gv-client-card\" href=\"#selena-dashmir\"><img src=\"/assets/seleena-dashmir-poster.jpg\" width=\"1315\" height=\"510\" alt=\"Selena &amp; Dashmir, a still from the GioLina wedding film\" decoding=\"async\"><span>Selena &amp; Dashmir</span></a></nav><section id=\"alexandria-james\" class=\"gv-client-event\" data-event-name=\"Alexandria &amp; James\" aria-labelledby=\"alexandria-james-title\"><header class=\"gv-client-heading\"><p class=\"gv-kicker\">Giando on the Water</p><h2 id=\"alexandria-james-title\">Alexandria &amp; James</h2></header><section id=\"alexandria-james-film\" class=\"gv-film-section\" aria-label=\"Alexandria &amp; James wedding film\"><div class=\"gv-film-heading\"><h3>The film</h3></div><div class=\"gl-film-preview gv-film\" style=\"aspect-ratio:442/180\"><img src=\"/assets/alexandria-james.png\" width=\"442\" height=\"180\" alt=\"Alexandria &amp; James, a still from the GioLina wedding film\" fetchpriority=\"high\" decoding=\"async\"><button type=\"button\" data-mediazilla-src=\"https://mediazilla.com/fAkBCNBFRB\" data-film-title=\"Alexandria &amp; James\" aria-label=\"Play wedding film, Alexandria &amp; James\"><span>Play wedding film</span></button></div><p class=\"gv-caption\">Alexandria &amp; James · A film by GioLina Films</p><p class=\"gv-caption\">Cinematography by GioLina Films.</p></section></section><section id=\"selena-dashmir\" class=\"gv-client-event\" data-event-name=\"Selena &amp; Dashmir\" aria-labelledby=\"selena-dashmir-title\"><header class=\"gv-client-heading\"><p class=\"gv-kicker\">Giando on the Water</p><h2 id=\"selena-dashmir-title\">Selena &amp; Dashmir</h2></header><section id=\"selena-dashmir-film\" class=\"gv-film-section\" aria-label=\"Selena &amp; Dashmir wedding film\"><div class=\"gv-film-heading\"><h3>The film</h3></div><div class=\"gl-film-preview gv-film\" style=\"aspect-ratio:1315/510\"><img src=\"/assets/seleena-dashmir-poster.jpg\" width=\"1315\" height=\"510\" alt=\"Selena &amp; Dashmir, a still from the GioLina wedding film\" fetchpriority=\"high\" decoding=\"async\"><button type=\"button\" data-vimeo-id=\"842690557\" data-film-title=\"Selena &amp; Dashmir\" aria-label=\"Play wedding film, Selena &amp; Dashmir\"><span>Play wedding film</span></button></div><p class=\"gv-caption\">Selena &amp; Dashmir · A film by GioLina Films</p><p class=\"gv-caption\">Photography and cinematography by GioLina Films.</p></section></section><section class=\"gv-context\" aria-labelledby=\"gv-context-title\"><div><p class=\"gv-kicker\">The setting · Brooklyn</p><h2 id=\"gv-context-title\">Giando on the Water</h2></div><div><p>Giando on the Water overlooks the East River from Kent Avenue in Brooklyn. GioLina provided cinematography for Alexandria and James, and photography and cinematography for Selena and Dashmir. Their films are presented separately here.</p><a class=\"gv-text-link\" href=\"https://www.giandoonthewater.com/\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\">Visit the venue website</a></div></section><section class=\"gv-inquire\" aria-labelledby=\"gv-inquire-title\"><h2 id=\"gv-inquire-title\">Your wedding at Giando on the Water</h2><p>Share your date, venue and the coverage you have in mind.</p><a class=\"gv-button\" href=\"/contact/\">Inquire about your wedding</a><div class=\"gv-links\"><a href=\"/cinematography/\">Explore wedding films</a><a href=\"/photography/\">Explore wedding photography</a></div></section><section class=\"gv-next\" aria-labelledby=\"gv-next-title\"><p class=\"gv-kicker\">Explore more wedding stories</p><h2 id=\"gv-next-title\"><a href=\"/weddings/gargiulos-brooklyn/\">Gargiulo’s · Francesca &amp; Chris</a></h2></section></article><script src=\"/mediazilla-player.js\" defer></script>"
